idor", :source-urls ["https://portal.mcgm.gov.in/irj/go/km/docs/documents/HomePage%20Data/Whats%20New/BMC%20Draft%20Policy%20Guidelines%20for%20Display%20of%20Outdoor%20Advertisements%202024.pdf"], :evidence-key "highway-authority-record", :legal-basis "市の outdoor advertising policy（BMC は国道 right-of-way 上を全面禁止）"} #:regulation{:jurisdiction "IND", :decision "height", :note "閾値は市ごとに違い、典型は 15 ft 超（≒4.6m）。2024 年の Ghatkopar 事故（17 名死亡）後に規制が強化された。", :authority "市自治体（登録構造技術者の証明）", :name "Structural stability certificate", :id "in-structural-stability", :category "structural", :threshold-height-m 4.6, :source-urls ["https://www.shubindiaadworks.com/blog/hoarding-permission-india-rules-regulations-guide"], :evidence-key "structural-permit-range-record", :legal-basis "市の outdoor advertising policy / building bye-laws"} #:regulation{:jurisdiction "JPN", :decision "zone", :note "防火地域内で、建築物の屋上に設けるもの、または高さ3m超は主要部分を不燃材料で造るか覆う。", :authority "建築主事／特定行政庁", :name "看板等の防火措置", :id "jp-building-code-64", :category "structural", :threshold-height-m 3, :source-urls ["https://www.mori-sign.jp/column/sign-building-code-structure"], :zone "fire-prevention-district", :evidence-key "building-code-64-record", :legal-basis "建築基準法第64条"} #:regulation{:jurisdiction "JPN", :decision "height", :authority "建築主事／指定確認検査機関", :name "工作物確認申請（広告塔・広告板）", :id "jp-building-code-88", :category "structural", :threshold-height-m 4, :source-urls ["https://www.city.ota.tokyo.jp/seikatsu/sumaimachinami/kenchiku/tatemono_tyuuikisei/kousakubutsu.html" "https://www.pref.nagano.lg.jp/toshikei/kurashi/sumai/kokoku/documents/takasanosantei.pdf"], :penalty "確認済証の交付前の着工は違反（1年以下の懲役または100万円以下の罰金）", :evidence-key "building-code-88-record", :legal-basis "建築基準法第88条第1項（施行令第138条第1項第3号）"} #:regulation{:jurisdiction "JPN", :decision "corridor", :authority "道路管理者（NEXCO 東日本・中日本・西日本 等）／都道府県", :name "高速道路の区域内／沿道の規制", :id "jp-expressway", :category "highway-corridor", :source-urls ["https://www.pref.wakayama.lg.jp/prefg/080900/okugaikoukok